OL,3,GNEWSAFlynn was emailed over ferry gas
OL,4,Aleak before he denied knowing about it
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlynn claimed he missed a BBC Scotland
OL,7,Freport on the incident as he was
OL,8,Ffacetiming his children before he
OL,9,Fappeared in front of the transport
OL,10,Fcommittee last month.
OL,12,FBut a briefing document released via a
OL,13,Ffreedom of information (FOI) request
OL,14,Fshowed Flynn was contacted about the
OL,15,Fstory twice in the hours between
OL,16,Fpublication and his committee
OL,17,Fappearance.
